  "name": "Arizona Fur Con",
  "shortName": "AFC",
  "description": "Arizona Fur Con (AZFurcon) was an annual furry convention in the Phoenix area of Arizona, organized by MonkeyPaw Entertainment. The first edition was held October 11 to 13, 2013, at the Embassy Suites Phoenix-Scottsdale. It later moved to the Scottsdale Resort at McCormick Ranch and then to the Mesa Convention Center, where attendance passed 1,300. Each year featured a theme, guests of honor and a local animal charity. Eleven conventions were held between 2013 and 2024, and the planned 2025 edition did not take place.",
